WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
I won’t go into details about the cause of death of these two people.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,540
Never do such stupid things again

3
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:06,540
think about the consequences

4
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:09,540
There were really two of them. They almost killed everyone.

5
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:12,690
Can't we do it directly in the camp?

6
00:00:12,690 --> 00:00:13,690
All ignored

7
00:00:13,690 --> 00:00:14,690
Who can watch you?

8
00:00:15,690 --> 00:00:16,690
Sorry, Captain Shen

9
00:00:16,690 --> 00:00:17,690
This is our dereliction of duty

10
00:00:17,690 --> 00:00:21,220
In the future, people will be arranged in the team to monitor

11
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:22,220
this kind of thing

12
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:23,220
Don't happen a second time

13
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:25,220
The study book just now

14
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:31,060
Before ignoring it, it was just an ordinary big tree

15
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:33,060
After changing again, it turned into a ghost tree

16
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:35,220
This world is really unfair

17
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:37,420
We still have to travel in the dark.

18
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:38,420
Indifference to human beings

19
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:50,910
like a torch in the dark

20
00:00:50,910 --> 00:00:51,910
Once discovered

21
00:00:51,910 --> 00:00:52,910
will continue to attract you from far away

22
00:00:52,910 --> 00:00:53,910
Countless memories
